  skos:notation "11-6" ;
  skos:definition "The subdivision of Canadian fisheries waters prescribed as Subarea 11-6 of Pacific fishery management Area 11, comprising those waters of Alison Sound, within the boundary described in paragraph (b) of item 11 of Schedule 2 to the Pacific Fishery Management Area Regulations, 2007."@en ;
  skos:scopeNote "Subarea 11-6 subdivides Pacific fishery management Area 11, which Fisheries and Oceans Canada's published area listing describes as Cape Caution, Westcott Point."@en ;
