  skos:inScheme gcdfo:PacificFisheryManagementSubareaScheme ;
  iao:0000119 "Government of Canada. Pacific Fishery Management Area Regulations, 2007 (SOR/2007-77), Schedule 2, item 11, paragraph (b) (Subarea 11-6). Consolidation current to 2026-06-21, last amended 2017-04-13; retrieved 2026-08-25."@en ;
  iao:0000119 "Fisheries and Oceans Canada. Maps of Pacific Fishery Management Areas (area listing, page modified 2021-12-08); retrieved 2026-08-25. Used for the parent Area's published locality description."@en ;
